ay\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/846958-how-does-a-human-become-a-beast?p=849620#post849620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I'm getting a better understanding of it :<br /> <br /> Also I'm currently using the Public Pdf, Is the full version released or a pdf version that I could purchase? I wasn't part of the kickstarter - does this mean I have no way of getting one?<br /> <br /> And is there other BEAST source material besides this current pdf?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Beast corebook is in indexing right now, so not too far off of release.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}